      "value": "@{5b0e261a56dd3e28e01af94c|full_name}: Some people will have a reaction of \"Thanks for the free gift,\" but it's important to keep in mind that gifting can be used as a form of harassment. A stalker sending unwanted gifts would be an example of this.",
