      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Some people are also uncomfortable because they may either not know the person gifting it well enough, believe (or know) the gifter cannot afford such an expense and giving such a gift is beyond their means, is uncomfortable being given gifts in general, or feel that the gift is being given with expectations of unreasonable recompense/strings attached that they did not and do not intend to agree to.   The latter of which ties into the harassment issue.  These are all examples I've heard from friends who find these to be legitimate concerns either presently or potentially in the future.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
