      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61c654278c7ca562c2ae4913|full_name}: I'd have to disagree. Trust is something you gain by being trustworthy. Part of what makes you less likely to be a troll/bot/burner account is spending money on that account. Doing so means you have more to lose should you be banned. The trust system is not a game-style xp system to measure your worth against others, it's a system that determines how likely you are to be a troll. And gifting operates in the same way - if someone trusts you enough in VRC to spend money on you, you're probably not a troll, and should have more of your avi features shown/be able to upload via the SDK.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
